m_assets/steam/apps/906660/extras/23aa7cdc1d4f4afb27674d329940cbd8.mp4?t=1572435343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/906660/extras/65fcdad15ac2ca268a667e81b8d73293.poster.avif?t=1572435343\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/906660/extras/65fcdad15ac2ca268a667e81b8d73293.webm?t=1572435343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/906660/extras/65fcdad15ac2ca268a667e81b8d73293.mp4?t=1572435343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
